This PR will enable to see a typical error that you get when running
two mature applications with one as a multiapp of the other. 

Test setup:
1. Clone both Bison and Pronghorn at the same level as your MOOSE directory.
2. Compile both against a common MOOSE/libMesh instance.
3. Run the Multiapp test in this diretory (CWD == this directory) with the 
   pronghorn executable you compiled in #2.

